# A test to see if we can reliably expand the upper window while it
# already has text in it without wrecking that existing text. Ideally
# this should create a three-line status bar. What happens to the
# main-window text underneath varies by implementation and does not
# really matter.

! SEED=1
! GAME=zcode-checkers/statustest.z5
! UPPER=yes

# The game never reads input, so the stream's only pause is its end,
# and that is where the upper window is written: after both main-window
# lines, not above them as on a screen. The three lines being there at
# all is the result; their place in the stream is not.
